  "details": "In the latest 1918 Beta, two new Chatbox bugs have been introduced.\n\n1. Chatbox requires two additional clicks before you can type\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Press Z / Y depending on your keyboard layout to open the Chatbox.\n\n2. Try to enter text. Typing does not work.\n\n3. Move your mouse cursor over the input field and click it.\n\n4. You can now enter text normally.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nPress Z / Y to open the Chatbox and immediately start typing without having to click the input field first.\n\n2. Chatbox text does not appear at all\n\nChatbox text does not appear regardless of whether Live Text is enabled or the message is manually sent.\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Press Z / Y and follow the steps from Issue 1 if necessary.\n\n2. Enter a message.\n\n3. Either use Live Text or press Send Message.\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nThe message should appear normally.\n\nActual behavior:\n\nThe message does not appear at all.\n\nAdditional information:\n\nSending Chatbox messages through OSC still works correctly.",
